     GUI applications; see zzvviieeww.

     The accepted keys:

                00-99, .        enter a number
                + - /         add, subtract, divide
                *, xx          multiply
                ^             y to the power x
                =, RREETTUURRNN     equals
                cc             Clear: start over (also clears Error)
                ee             CE: clear the entry, keep the pending operation
                nn             change the sign of the display
                pp             enter pi
                BBSS, DDEELL       rub out the last typed digit
                ss oo tt         sin, cos, tan
                ll gg           ln, log10
                jj             e to the power x
